{"policyVersion":3,"items":[{"translations":{"en":["Majin Bone","Ordinary high school students Shougo Ryuujin, Tyrone, Antonio, and Luke are the White Bone warriors. With their special Bone Cards they defend Earth from the evil Dark Bone, who has come from the darkness to destroy our world. However, the true identity of the \"enemy\" is still uncertain.\n\n\n\n(Source: Anime News Network)"],"ja":["マジンボーン",""]},"airedAt":null,"relations":[],"id":"mal-21835","ids":{"shikimori":21835,"mal":21835,"anilist":20621,"kodik":"serial-6321"},"kodikIds":["serial-6321"],"kodikRevisions":{"serial-6321":"2019-11-30T12:00:38Z"},"title":"Кость Маджина","originalTitle":"Majin Bone","alt":"マジンボーン マジンボーン","description":"Эта история началась до того, как появилась Земля. А в наши дни создатель вселенной, Майдзин, вдруг ожил, и одновременно с этим на Землю сошли гости из темноты. Опасность приближается к Земле, пока трое неизвестных преследуют 16-летнего паренька . Неужели этот юноша — Избранный? Неужели он последняя надежда человечества? Старшеклассник Сёго Рюдзин проводил дни в тишине и покое, но его спокойные будни вот-вот подойдут к концу.","year":2014,"type":"TV","genres":["стратегические игры"],"rating":6.69,"popularity":2421,"ongoing":false,"relatedMalIds":[],"artwork":{"poster":{"url":"https://shikimori.io/uploads/poster/animes/21835/12d272479bf9328dc3edb5eb0bd307a6.jpeg","width":310,"height":445},"backdrop":{"url":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/n20621-wpf3UxyL8BQX.jpg","width":1280,"height":720}},"releasedEpisodes":[1,2,3],"episodes":[{"number":1,"ordinal":1,"season":1,"audio":[{"id":"kodik-609","dubId":"609","label":"AniDUB","language":"ru","original":false,"duration":null,"sources":[],"subtitles":[],"opening":null,"ending":null,"validation":"provider-link","providerRef":{"provider":"kodik","releaseId":"serial-6321","translationId":"609","url":"https://kodikplayer.com/seria/169286/c252ea626f424c2a3ac6a4c42306ea09/720p","season":1,"ordinal":1}}]},{"num